-- src:594 | bệnh tật);
-- src:595 | • Các hợp đồng tái tục liên tục mặc nhiên có hiệu lực ngay sau khi Bên tham gia bảo hiểm đóng phí đầy đủ cho thời gian
-- src:596 | tiếp theo.
-- src:408 | b. Thời gian chờ:
-- src:409 | • Chín mươi (90) ngày kể từ ngày bắt đầu bảo hiểm đối với trường hợp cắt bỏ buồng trứng, điều trị thai sản, sảy thai, phá thai
-- src:410 | theo chỉ định của Bác sỹ;
-- src:411 | • Ba trăm sáu mươi lăm (365) ngày kể từ ngày bắt đầu bảo hiểm đối với trường hợp sinh đẻ.
-- src:552 | Đối với trường hợp chương trình tái tục tham gia với lựa chọn cao hơn chương trình năm liền trước thì phần quyền lợi cao hơn
-- src:553 | sẽ vẫn phải áp dụng thời gian chờ.

-- The length of the waiting period for the item: benefit 4(b) for maternity care; Part 4
-- clause 5 for an illness; none for an accident or for newborn care (fork F28).
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the waiting period, in days, for` i MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the benefit of` i EQUALS `benefit 4: maternity care`
              THEN `benefit 4(b): the waiting period, in days, for` ((`the line of` i)'s `the head of cost`)
           IF `clause 5 treats as illness the event` (`the event of` i)
              THEN JUST (`the waiting period for illness, in days, under` (`the schedule of` i))
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- A benefit that a continuous renewal added: all of it is "the part that is higher".
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the benefit was added at a continuous renewal, for` i MEANS
    CONSIDER (`the policy of` i)'s `the schedule for the previous period`
    WHEN NOTHING    THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST prev  THEN     (`the policy of` i)'s `renewed continuously`
                         AND NOT ((`the benefit of` i) `was bought in` prev)

-- The last day of the waiting period that bars the item, if one does. Measured from the
-- start date of fork F3; for a benefit added at a continuous renewal, also from the first
-- day of cover in the current period.
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`the last day of the waiting period that bars` i MEANS
    CONSIDER `the waiting period, in days, for` i
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST n  THEN
        BRANCH IF `a waiting period of` n `days, counted from` start `, contains` d
                  THEN JUST (`the last day of a waiting period of` n `days, counted from` start)
               IF `the benefit was added at a continuous renewal, for` i AND `a waiting period of` n `days, counted from` current `, contains` d
                  THEN JUST (`the last day of a waiting period of` n `days, counted from` current)
               OTHERWISE NOTHING
    WHERE
        d MEANS (`the line of` i)'s `the date`
        start MEANS `the start date for` i
        current MEANS `the first day of cover in the current period of` (`the policy of` i)

§§ `Limits`
-- src:56 | 12. Tổng giới hạn bồi thường (Giới hạn chính)
-- src:57 | Là giới hạn trách nhiệm tối đa của PTI đối với Người được bảo hiểm trong suốt thời hạn bảo hiểm. Giới hạn này được qui định
-- src:58 | trong Hợp đồng bảo hiểm.
-- src:70 | 13. Giới hạn phụ
-- src:71 | Là giới hạn trách nhiệm tối đa áp dụng cho mỗi quyền lợi bảo hiểm được qui định chi tiết trong Hợp đồng bảo hiểm. Tuy nhiên
-- src:72 | tổng các giới hạn chi tiết không vượt quá số tiền bảo hiểm tối đa của mỗi chương trình.

-- What has been counted against one limit so far.
GIVEN l IS A `A limit`
      counted IS A LIST OF `An amount counted against a limit`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount counted against` l `in` counted MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the amount`) (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the limit` EQUALS l) counted))

-- The same item, read against the previous period's schedule (Part 4 clause 3).
GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
      prev IS A `The schedule`
GIVETH AN `An item of a claim`
`the item` i `read against the schedule` prev MEANS
    `An item of a claim` WITH
        `the claim` IS `The claim` WITH
            `the insured person`                    IS c's `the insured person`
            `the policy`                            IS `The policy` WITH
                `the schedule`                                       IS prev
                `the schedule for the previous period`               IS NOTHING
                `date of joining`                                    IS p's `date of joining`
                `first day of the period, as the certificate states` IS p's `first day of the period, as the certificate states`
                `last day of the period, as the certificate states`  IS p's `last day of the period, as the certificate states`
                `date PTI received the premium in full`              IS p's `date PTI received the premium in full`
                `renewed continuously`                               IS p's `renewed continuously`
                `the annual premium`                                 IS p's `the annual premium`
            `the event`                             IS c's `the event`
            `the items`                             IS c's `the items`
            `the filing`                            IS c's `the filing`
            `other insurance`                       IS c's `other insurance`
            `already counted earlier in the period` IS c's `already counted earlier in the period`
        `the item` IS i's `the item`
    WHERE
        c MEANS i's `the claim`
        p MEANS c's `the policy`

-- The size of a limit for this item. During the waiting period counted from the first day of
-- the current period, a continuous renewal at a higher option pays within last year's size.
GIVEN l IS A `A limit that applies`
      i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the size of` l `for` i MEANS
    CONSIDER `the waiting period, in days, for` i
    WHEN NOTHING THEN l's `its size`
    WHEN JUST n  THEN
        CONSIDER (`the policy of` i)'s `the schedule for the previous period`
        WHEN NOTHING   THEN l's `its size`
        WHEN JUST prev THEN
            IF     (`the policy of` i)'s `renewed continuously`
               AND `a waiting period of` n `days, counted from` current `, contains` ((`the line of` i)'s `the date`)
            THEN min (l's `its size`) (`last year's size` prev)
            ELSE l's `its size`
    WHERE
        current MEANS `the first day of cover in the current period of` (`the policy of` i)
        `last year's size` prev MEANS
            sum (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `its size`)
                     (filter (GIVEN x YIELD x's `the limit` EQUALS l's `the limit`)
                             (`Part 2: the limits that apply to` (`the item` i `read against the schedule` prev))))

§§ `The amount payable for an item`
-- src:597 | 6. Đồng bảo hiểm/các Đơn bảo hiểm giống nhau
-- src:598 | Trong trường hợp chi phí y tế liên quan tới cùng thương tật, bệnh tật được bảo hiểm theo Quy tắc này có thể đòi bồi thường từ
-- src:599 | những loại hình bảo hiểm khác, PTI chỉ thanh toán khoản tiền vượt quá mức được bồi thường theo các Quy tắc bảo hiểm khác
-- src:600 | đó hoặc theo tỷ lệ giữa số tiền bảo hiểm của Quy tắc bảo hiểm này với tổng giới hạn trách nhiệm của tất cả Quy tắc bảo hiểm.

GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
      counted IS A LIST OF `An amount counted against a limit`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount payable for` i `, given what was counted before:` counted MEANS
    CONSIDER i's `the claim`'s `other insurance`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `within the limits`
    WHEN JUST o  THEN
        IF   i `is a cost, not a fixed sum`
        THEN `clause 6: PTI pays, of` `within the limits` `on a cost of` base `with a limit of` `the first limit` `, given` o
        ELSE `within the limits`
    WHERE
        base MEANS `Part 2: the amount before limits for` i
        limits MEANS `Part 2: the limits that apply to` i
        `room under` l MEANS max 0 (`the size of` l `for` i MINUS `the amount counted against` (l's `the limit`) `in` counted)
        `within the limits` MEANS minimum (base FOLLOWED BY map (GIVEN l YIELD `room under` l) limits)
        `the first limit` MEANS
            CONSIDER limits
            WHEN l FOLLOWED BY rest THEN `the size of` l `for` i
            WHEN EMPTY THEN base

§§ `The outcome for an item, and for a claim`

GIVEN i IS AN `An item of a claim`
      counted IS A LIST OF `An amount counted against a limit`
GIVETH A `The outcome for an item`
`the outcome for` i `, given what was counted before:` counted MEANS
    CONSIDER `Part 2: why this item is not covered, if it is not:` i
    WHEN JUST r  THEN `not covered` r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
        IF   NOT null (`the exclusions of Part 3 that apply to` i)
        THEN `excluded` (`the exclusions of Part 3 that apply to` i)
        ELSE CONSIDER `the last day of the waiting period that bars` i
             WHEN JUST d  THEN `in a waiting period` d
             WHEN NOTHING THEN `payable` (`the amount payable for` i `, given what was counted before:` counted)

GIVEN o IS A `The outcome for an item`
      i IS AN `An item of a claim`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An amount counted against a limit`
`what` o `counts against the limits of` i MEANS
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `payable` a THEN
        map (GIVEN l YIELD `An amount counted against a limit` WITH `the limit` IS l's `the limit`, `the amount` IS a)
            (`Part 2: the limits that apply to` i)
    OTHERWISE EMPTY

GIVEN items IS A LIST OF `An item of a claim`
      counted IS A LIST OF `An amount counted against a limit`
GIVETH A LIST OF `The outcome for an item`
`the outcomes for` items `, given what was counted before:` counted MEANS
    CONSIDER items
    WHEN EMPTY THEN EMPTY
    WHEN i FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        LET o MEANS `the outcome for` i `, given what was counted before:` counted
        IN  o FOLLOWED BY `the outcomes for` rest `, given what was counted before:` (append (`what` o `counts against the limits of` i) counted)

GIVEN o IS A `The outcome for an item`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount paid on` o MEANS
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `payable` a THEN a
    OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A `The outcome for a claim`
`the outcome for the claim` c MEANS
    IF   `clause 1 refuses in full, for lateness,` c
    THEN `refused in full, the claim being filed late`
    ELSE `assessed` outcomes (sum (map (GIVEN o YIELD `the amount paid on` o) outcomes))
    WHERE
        outcomes MEANS `the outcomes for` (`the items of` c) `, given what was counted before:` (c's `already counted earlier in the period`)

GIVEN c IS A `The claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the total payable on the claim` c MEANS
    CONSIDER `the outcome for the claim` c
    WHEN `assessed` os t THEN t
    WHEN `refused in full, the claim being filed late` THEN 0
